    ultimate: { name: "Tutto elementale", slot: "ultimate", spriteSource: "famiglia", ranks: [{ rank: 1, text: "Inflicts damage equal to [FFAE00]400%[-] of Attack on [FFFFFF]all enemies[-] and creates barriers around all allies equal to [FFAE00]5%[-] of damage, taking damage only from basic stats.\\n[00D5FF](Excludes Rupture effect)[-]" }, { rank: 2, text: "Inflicts damage equal to [FFAE00]440%[-] of Attack on [FFFFFF]all enemies[-] and creates barriers around all allies equal to [FFAE00]6%[-] of damage, taking damage only from basic stats.\\n[00D5FF](Excludes Rupture effect)[-]" }, { rank: 3, text: "Inflicts damage equal to [FFAE00]480%[-] of Attack on [FFFFFF]all enemies[-] and creates barriers around all allies equal to [FFAE00]8%[-] of damage, taking damage only from basic stats.\\n[00D5FF](Excludes Rupture effect)[-]" }, { rank: 4, text: "Inflicts damage equal to [FFAE00]520%[-] of Attack on [FFFFFF]all enemies[-] and creates barriers around all allies equal to [FFAE00]11%[-] of damage, taking damage only from basic stats.\\n[00D5FF](Excludes Rupture effect)[-]" }, { rank: 5, text: "Inflicts damage equal to [FFAE00]560%[-] of Attack on [FFFFFF]all enemies[-] and creates barriers around all allies equal to [FFAE00]15%[-] of damage, taking damage only from basic stats.\\n[00D5FF](Excludes Rupture effect)[-]" }, { rank: 6, text: "Inflicts damage equal to [FFAE00]600%[-] of Attack on [FFFFFF]all enemies[-] and creates barriers around all allies equal to [FFAE00]20%[-] of damage, taking damage only from basic stats.\\n[00D5FF](Excludes Rupture effect)[-]" }] },
    passive: { name: "Onde estive", text: "Increases basic stats of [00D5FF]Applicable Allies[-] by [FFAE00]7%[-] and their Max HP by [FFAE00]5%[-] for [FFAE00]each[-] one participating in battle.\\n[i][C0C0C0]※Applicable Allies: Unknown race and [The Seven Deadly Sins][-][/i]\\n\\nAt the start of battle, grants all enemies [00D5FF]Barnacle[-] for [FFAE00]3 turns[-], and decreases the Max HP of enemies afflicted with [00D5FF]Barnacle[-] by [FFAE00]20%[-].\\n[i][C0C0C0]※Barnacle: Additional damage equal to [FFAE00]20%[-] of remaining HP at the end of every turn.[-][/i]\\n\\nWhen the hero [00D5FF]enters battle from the Secondary Slot[-], it grants [00D5FF]Applicable Allies[-] [00D5FF]Sea's Magic[-] for [FFAE00]2 turns[-], and for [FFAE00]each[-] stack of [00D5FF]Barnacle[-] on the enemy, [00D5FF]Applicable Allies[-] recover [FFAE00]10%[-] of Max HP.\\n[i][C0C0C0]※Sea's Magic: For every [FFAE00]4%[-] of remaining HP when using a skill or counter, Attack-related stats increase by [FFAE00]2%[-].\\nDamage taken from skills during the enemy's turn does not exceed [FF8000]50%[-] of Max HP.[-][/i]", ultimateSteps: [{ fromUltimateRank: 2, text: "Increases basic stats of [00D5FF]Applicable Allies[-] by [FFAE00]7%[-] and their Max HP by [FFAE00]5%[-] for [FFAE00]each[-] one participating in battle.\\n[i][C0C0C0]※Applicable Allies: Unknown race and [The Seven Deadly Sins][-][/i]\\n\\nAt the start of battle, grants all enemies [00D5FF]Barnacle[-] for [FFAE00]3 turns[-], and decreases the Max HP of enemies afflicted with [00D5FF]Barnacle[-] by [FFAE00]20%[-].\\n[i][C0C0C0]※Barnacle: Additional damage equal to [FFAE00]20%[-] of remaining HP at the end of every turn.[-][/i]\\n\\nWhen the hero [00D5FF]enters battle from the Secondary Slot[-], it grants [00D5FF]Applicable Allies[-] [00D5FF]Sea's Magic[-] for [FFAE00]2 turns[-], and for [FFAE00]each[-] stack of [00D5FF]Barnacle[-] on the enemy, [00D5FF]Applicable Allies[-] recover [FFAE00]10%[-] of Max HP.\\n[i][C0C0C0]※Sea's Magic: For every [FFAE00]4%[-] of remaining HP when using a skill or counter, Attack-related stats increase by [FFAE00]2%[-].\\nDamage taken from skills during the enemy's turn does not exceed [FF8000]40%[-] of Max HP.[-][/i]" }] },
