    passive: { name: "Queen of Snow", text: "For [FFAE00]each[-] [00D5FF]Applicable Ally[-] participating in battle, their basic stats increase by [FFAE00]5%[-] and [00D5FF]damage dealt[-] increases by [FFAE00]10%[-].\\n[i][C0C0C0]※ Applicable Allies: Goddess, [The Seven Deadly Sins][-][/i]\\n\\nFor [FFAE00]each[-] Buff applied to an [00D5FF]Applicable Ally[-], Attack-related stats of [00D5FF]Applicable Allies[-] increase by [FFAE00]5%[-].\\n[00D5FF](Limit [FFAE00]6[-])[-]\\n\\nApplies [00D5FF]Frost Shield[-] on [00D5FF]Applicable Allies[-] for [FFAE00]2 turns[-] at the start of the battle.\\n[i][C0C0C0]※ Frost Shield: Damage taken [FFAE00]-50%[-], Max HP [FFAE00]+20%[-], Freeze Immunity, decreases damage dealt by enemies that used a skill to deal damage by [FFAE00]40%[-] for [FFAE00]2 turns[-].[-][/i]\\n\\nBasic stats of [00D5FF]Applicable Allies[-] increase by [FFAE00]4%[-] for each [00D5FF]Debuff removed[-] from [00D5FF]Applicable Allies[-] by the hero.\\n[00D5FF](Limit [FFAE00]5[-])[-]\\n\\nAt the start of the allies' turn, [00D5FF]Ice Sword[-] is granted to the [00D5FF]ally with the highest remaining HP percentage[-] for [FFAE00]1 turn[-].\\n[i][C0C0C0]※ Ice Sword: Additional damage equal to [FF8000]10%[-] of remaining HP[-][/i]", ultimateSteps: [{ fromUltimateRank: 2, text: "For [FFAE00]each[-] [00D5FF]Applicable Ally[-] participating in battle, their basic stats increase by [FFAE00]5%[-] and [00D5FF]damage dealt[-] increases by [FFAE00]10%[-].\\n[i][C0C0C0]※ Applicable Allies: Goddess, [The Seven Deadly Sins][-][/i]\\n\\nFor [FFAE00]each[-] Buff applied to an [00D5FF]Applicable Ally[-], Attack-related stats of [00D5FF]Applicable Allies[-] increase by [FFAE00]5%[-].\\n[00D5FF](Limit [FFAE00]6[-])[-]\\n\\nApplies [00D5FF]Frost Shield[-] on [00D5FF]Applicable Allies[-] for [FFAE00]2 turns[-] at the start of the battle.\\n[i][C0C0C0]※ Frost Shield: Damage taken [FFAE00]-50%[-], Max HP [FFAE00]+20%[-], Freeze Immunity, decreases damage dealt by enemies that used a skill to deal damage by [FFAE00]40%[-] for [FFAE00]2 turns[-].[-][/i]\\n\\nBasic stats of [00D5FF]Applicable Allies[-] increase by [FFAE00]4%[-] for each [00D5FF]Debuff removed[-] from [00D5FF]Applicable Allies[-] by the hero.\\n[00D5FF](Limit [FFAE00]5[-])[-]\\n\\nAt the start of the allies' turn, [00D5FF]Ice Sword[-] is granted to the [00D5FF]ally with the highest remaining HP percentage[-] for [FFAE00]1 turn[-].\\n[i][C0C0C0]※ Ice Sword: Additional damage equal to [FF8000]20%[-] of remaining HP[-][/i]" }] },
