    passive: { name: "Incubo scatenato", text: "The hero's Max HP increases by [FFAE00]10%[-] for [FFAE00]each[-] [00D5FF]Applicable Ally[-] participating in battle.\\n[i][C0C0C0]※Applicable Ally: Demons and heroes with Commandments[-][/i]\\n\\n[00D5FF]Taunts[-] enemies for [FFAE00]1 turn[-] at the start of the battle.\\n\\nIf there are [FFAE00]2[-] or more enemies when the hero [00D5FF]uses a single-target attack[-] to inflict damage, the target's [00D5FF]Mark of Nightmare[-] is removed, and a new [00D5FF]Mark of Nightmare[-] is applied on them for [FFAE00]3 turns[-].\\n[i][C0C0C0]※Mark of Nightmare: Only Berserk Meliodas can be targeted.\\nDoes not stack with Fascination, Mark, or Coerce.[-][/i]\\n\\nThe hero's damage taken from skills used by enemies with a [00D5FF]Mark of Nightmare[-] does not exceed [FF8000]60%[-] of the hero's Max HP.\\n\\nIf the hero is hit [FFAE00]2 times[-] during the enemy's turn, or if an [00D5FF]Applicable Ally[-] dies, the hero gains [00D5FF]Rampage[-] for [FFAE00]2 turns[-].\\n[i][C0C0C0]※Rampage: All stats [FFAE00]+10%[-].\\nInflicts additional damage equal to [FFAE00]30%[-] of the hero's Max HP when using skills.\\nImmune to Commandment effects.[-][/i]\\n\\nWhen the hero inflicts damage on the enemy, or when an [00D5FF]Applicable Ally[-] takes damage from a skill during the enemy's turn, the hero gains [FFAE00]1[-] effect which increases HP-related stats by [FFAE00]10%[-], up to a maximum of [FFAE00]5[-], for [FFAE00]3 turns[-], and all enemies are inflicted with [FFAE00]1[-] effect which increases their [00D5FF]damage taken[-] by [FFAE00]5%[-], up to a maximum of [FFAE00]5[-], for [FFAE00]3 turns[-].", ultimateSteps: [{ fromUltimateRank: 2, text: "The hero's Max HP increases by [FFAE00]10%[-] for [FFAE00]each[-] [00D5FF]Applicable Ally[-] participating in battle.\\n[i][C0C0C0]※Applicable Ally: Demons and heroes with Commandments[-][/i]\\n\\n[00D5FF]Taunts[-] enemies for [FFAE00]1 turn[-] at the start of the battle.\\n\\nIf there are [FFAE00]2[-] or more enemies when the hero [00D5FF]uses a single-target attack[-] to inflict damage, the target's [00D5FF]Mark of Nightmare[-] is removed, and a new [00D5FF]Mark of Nightmare[-] is applied on them for [FFAE00]3 turns[-].\\n[i][C0C0C0]※Mark of Nightmare: Only Berserk Meliodas can be targeted.\\nDoes not stack with Fascination, Mark, or Coerce.[-][/i]\\n\\nThe hero's damage taken from skills used by enemies with a [00D5FF]Mark of Nightmare[-] does not exceed [FF8000]50%[-] of the hero's Max HP.\\n\\nIf the hero is hit [FFAE00]2 times[-] during the enemy's turn, or if an [00D5FF]Applicable Ally[-] dies, the hero gains [00D5FF]Rampage[-] for [FFAE00]2 turns[-].\\n[i][C0C0C0]※Rampage: All stats [FFAE00]+10%[-].\\nInflicts additional damage equal to [FFAE00]30%[-] of the hero's Max HP when using skills.\\nImmune to Commandment effects.[-][/i]\\n\\nWhen the hero inflicts damage on the enemy, or when an [00D5FF]Applicable Ally[-] takes damage from a skill during the enemy's turn, the hero gains [FFAE00]1[-] effect which increases HP-related stats by [FFAE00]10%[-], up to a maximum of [FFAE00]5[-], for [FFAE00]3 turns[-], and all enemies are inflicted with [FFAE00]1[-] effect which increases their [00D5FF]damage taken[-] by [FFAE00]5%[-], up to a maximum of [FFAE00]5[-], for [FFAE00]3 turns[-]." }] },
