    passive: { name: "Knight of Flames", text: "Increases [00D5FF]Human allies'[-] basic stats by [FFAE00]5%[-] for [FFAE00]each[-] one participating in battle.\\n\\nAt the start of the battle, [FFAE00]2[-] [00D5FF]Hellbrand[-] effects are applied on all enemies for [FFAE00]3 turns[-].\\n[i][C0C0C0]※Hellbrand: Damage taken [FFAE00]+20%[-], damage dealt [FFAE00]-20%[-].\\nInflicts additional damage equal to [FFAE00]10%[-] of the target's Max HP when the effect is removed due to skills, Uniques, Commandments, or elapsed turns.\\n(Stacks [FFAE00]3 times[-])[/i][-]\\n\\nApplies [00D5FF]Hellbrand[-] for [FFAE00]3 turns[-] on enemies that take damage from the hero's [00D5FF]all-target attack[-].\\n\\nDecreases [00D5FF]Human allies'[-] damage taken by [FFAE00]5%[-] for [FFAE00]each[-] [00D5FF]Hellbrand[-] applied to enemies.\\n[00D5FF](Limit [FFAE00]10 times[-])[-]\\n\\nWhen the hero uses a [00D5FF]single-target attack[-] other than their Ultimate Move to deal damage to an enemy with the maximum number of [00D5FF]Hellbrand[-] effects stacked, [FFAE00]1[-] Buff is removed from the target.\\n\\nWhen the hero uses a [00D5FF]single-target attack[-] other than their Ultimate Move to deal damage to an enemy, all [00D5FF]Hellbrand[-] effects are removed from the target.\\n\\nThe hero's damage taken decreases by [FFAE00]1%[-] for every [FFAE00]1%[-] of remaining HP." },
