    passive: { name: "Martello del giudizio", text: "At the start of the battle, applies [00D5FF]Divine Lightning[-] on the hero and decreases [00D5FF]Applicable Allies'[-] [00D5FF]damage taken[-] by [FFAE00]30%[-] for [FFAE00]2 turns[-]. When [00D5FF]Divine Lightning[-] reaches its [00D5FF]maximum value, the effect is removed[-] and the hero gains [00D5FF]Thundergod's Judgment[-] for [FFAE00]3 turns[-].\\nIn addition, for [FFAE00]each[-] [00D5FF]Applicable Ally[-] participating in battle, all of the hero's stats are increased by [FFAE00]5%[-]. For [FFAE00]each[-] Buff or Debuff applied to [00D5FF]Applicable Allies[-], the hero's [00D5FF]damage dealt[-] increases by [FFAE00]4%[-], up to [FFAE00]40%[-].\\n\\n[00D5FF]※Applicable Ally: Unknown race, [Ragnarok]\\n※Divine Lightning: Damage dealt and damage taken accumulate up to [FFAE00]300,000[-].\\nInflicts additional damage equal to [FFAE00]30%[-] of the stored damage when using a skill.\\n[FFAE00]+50%[-] damage dealt to Taunted targets.\\n※Thundergod's Judgment: Attack-related stats [FFAE00]+30%[-].\\nInflicts additional damage equal to [FFAE00]50%[-] of the final damage to all enemies when using a single-target attack.\\n[FFAE00]+50%[-] damage dealt to Taunted targets.\\nApplies Divine Lightning when removed.[-]" },
