    passive: { name: "Maga del Mare", text: "Applies [FFAE00]1[-] [00D5FF]random[-] [00D5FF]Element[-] on an enemy unaffected by [00D5FF]Elements[-] at the start of the allies' turn, then increases the hero's basic stats by [FFAE00]7%[-] for [FFAE00]each[-] [00D5FF]Element[-] on the enemy. When an ally uses a skill on an enemy affected by an [00D5FF]Element[-], it additionally applies the corresponding [00D5FF]Elemental Effect[-] for [FFAE00]3 turns[-]. At [FFAE00]4[-] [00D5FF]Elemental Effect[-] stacks, [00D5FF]it removes the Element and Elemental Effects[-], then applies the corresponding Debuff effect of the [00D5FF]Element[-] for [FFAE00]1 turn[-].\\n\\nIn addition, basic stats of [00D5FF]Unknown race allies[-] are increased by [FFAE00]5%[-] for [FFAE00]each[-] one participating in battle. If an [00D5FF]Elemental Effect[-] is [00D5FF]removed due to a Unique ability or Holy Relic effect[-], it inflicts damage equal to [FFAE00]15%[-] of the enemy's remaining HP for [FFAE00]each[-] [00D5FF]Elemental Effect[-] removed.\\n[00D5FF](Does not apply to instances where effects are removed when the target survives due to a Unique ability or Holy Relic effect)[-]\\n\\n[00D5FF](Rockslide: Stun / Combustion: [FFAE00]50%[-] of Max HP as Additional Damage / Diffusion: Attack Disable / Gust: [FFAE00]100%[-] Crit Chance Decrease)[-]" },
