    passive: { name: "Ombre oscure", text: "Increases the hero's [00D5FF]Crit Defense[-] by [FFAE00]20%[-] for [FFAE00]each[-] [00D5FF]Applicable Ally[-] participating in battle.\\n[i][C0C0C0]※Applicable Ally: Unknown race, [Sacrifice], [The Seven Catastrophes][-][/i]\\n\\nApplies [00D5FF]Dark Moon's Shield[-] on the hero for [FFAE00]1 turn[-] at the start of the battle.\\n[i][C0C0C0]※Dark Moon's Shield: Taunts enemies, Applicable Allies' damage taken [FFAE00]-30%[-], hero's damage taken [FFAE00]-50%[-].[-][/i]\\n\\nIf there are [FFAE00]2[-] or more enemies participating in battle at the start of the allies' turn, applies [00D5FF]Enhanced Hallucination[-] on the [00D5FF]enemy with the lowest HP percentage[-] and [00D5FF]Hallucination[-] on all other enemies. These effects are removed when taking [00D5FF]Delusion[-] damage from the hero.\\n[i][C0C0C0]※Enhanced Hallucination: Applies Enhanced Mind Break when removed.\\n※Hallucination: Applies Mind Break when removed.[-][/i]\\n\\nInflicting damage on an enemy afflicted with [00D5FF]Enhanced Mind Break[-] or [00D5FF]Mind Break[-] removes the effect.\\n[i][C0C0C0]※Enhanced Mind Break: Attack-related stats [FFAE00]-20%[-].\\nStuns for [FFAE00]1 turn[-] when removed.\\n※Mind Break: Attack-related stats [FFAE00]-20%[-].\\nDisables single or all-target attacks for [FFAE00]1 turn[-] when removed.[-][/i]\\n\\nThe hero gains [00D5FF]Dark Moon's Shield[-] for [FFAE00]1 turn[-] when inflicting [00D5FF]Dark Moon[-] damage." },
