    passive: { name: "The Only Sun", text: "Applies [00D5FF]Burning Sun[-] on the hero at the start of the battle. For [FFAE00]1 turn[-], the hero does not take more than [FFAE00]50%[-] of their Max HP as damage from skills during the enemy's turn. If the hero dies, allies gain [00D5FF]Burning Sun[-] for [FFAE00]3 turns[-].\\nIn addition, all of the hero's stats are increased by [FFAE00]5%[-] for [FFAE00]each[-] [00D5FF]applicable ally[-] participating in battle, and the hero's Attack-related stats are increased by [FFAE00]20%[-] for [FFAE00]each[-] [00D5FF]applicable ally[-] that dies. The hero is always [00D5FF]immune to stat decrease effects[-].\\n\\n[00D5FF]※Burning Sun: Inflicts additional damage equal to [FFAE00]40%[-] of the target's increased Max HP when using a single-target attack.\\n※Applicable Ally: Humans, [The Seven Deadly Sins][-]" },
