    passive: { name: "Sprouted Wings", text: "Increases [00D5FF]Fairy allies'[-] basic stats by [FFAE00]5%[-] for [FFAE00]each[-] one participating in battle.\\n\\nGrants [00D5FF]Fairy allies[-] [00D5FF]Gift of Life[-] for [FFAE00]2 turns[-] at the start of the battle.\\n[i][C0C0C0]※Gift of Life: HP-related stats [FFAE00]+15%[-].\\nImmune to Recovery-related stat restrictions.\\nImmediately recovers HP equal to [FFAE00]50%[-] of their damage taken when attacked during the enemy's turn.[-][/i]\\n\\nIf the hero has [00D5FF]Gift of Life[-], they become immune to [00D5FF]Ignite[-] effects.\\n\\nWhen a [00D5FF]Fairy ally[-] uses a skill on an enemy or counters their attack, it inflicts additional damage equal to [FFAE00]15%[-] of the attacker's Max HP and applies the [00D5FF]Bleed[-] effect for [FFAE00]2 turns[-] when damage is dealt using a skill.\\n\\nFor [FFAE00]each[-] [00D5FF]Poison, Bleed, Shock, and Corrosion[-] effect on an enemy, their Attack-related stats decrease by [FFAE00]10%[-].\\n\\nEach time the hero inflicts a [00D5FF]Bleed, Shock, or Corrosion[-] effect on an enemy, their basic stats increase by [FFAE00]5%[-].\\n[00D5FF](Limit [FFAE00]10 times[-])[-]" },
